# Claude Code worktrees: live checkouts of this same repository, never content
# to track. Five were committed by accident in 0c6a527 as mode-160000 gitlinks
# with no .gitmodules, which broke `git submodule status` and left five empty
# directories in every clone.
#
# Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of .claude/ so a shared settings.json or
# agents/ can still be committed deliberately. settings.local.json is already
# covered as a local file.
.claude/worktrees/